What are the different libraries required to run COBOL programs?
Library	Purpose
Source library	Stores COBOL source code
Copybook library	Stores reusable COBOL data definitions
Object library	Stores compiled object modules
Load library	Stores executable load modules
Procedure library	Stores cataloged JCL procedures
DBRM library	Stores DB2 Database Request Modules


USER.COBOL.SOURCE
USER.COBOL.COPYLIB
USER.COBOL.OBJLIB
USER.COBOL.LOADLIB
USER.JCL.PROCLIB
USER.DB2.DBRMLIB
